# desktop utilities, so Emergence pins two reviewed overlays at fixed commits
# (see build.sh: EMERGENCE_GURU_COMMIT / EMERGENCE_HYPROVERLAY_COMMIT).
# Only the atoms below (plus their ~amd64-only overlay dependencies) are
# accepted from those overlays; the baseline remains the Gentoo tree.
